								"draggable": true,
								"content": "The Salvation Army Women's Auxiliary's membership is always open. We exist for the sole purpose of helping others. Serving others&nbsp;is the core of every project we support and promote. Our mission is to be “the Army Behind the Army” helping The Salvation Army meet the need of others.",
